        "r": 295.4299999999999,
        "b": 720.7
      },
      "content": "Pull down on the assembly to remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4293",
      "reading_order": 5921,
      "section": "6. Remove the formatter.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 470.42,
        "r": 262.97999999999996,
        "b": 458.83
      },
      "content": "Remove the cartridge door assembly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4294",
      "reading_order": 5922,
      "section": "6. Remove the formatter.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 446.92,
        "r": 477.43,
        "b": 435.33
      },
      "content": "NOTE: If the toner cartridge was not removed prior to servicing the printer, remove it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4295",
      "reading_order": 5923,
      "section": "6. Remove the formatter.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 424.42,
        "r": 512.1700000000005,
        "b": 412.83
      },
      "content": "Release the support shaft (callout 1), and then slide it toward the center of the door (callout 2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4296",
      "reading_order": 5924,
      "section": "6. Remove the formatter.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 400.92,
        "r": 500.31,
        "b": 389.33
      },
      "content": "TIP: It might be easier to release the support shaft by using a small flat-blade screwdriver ."
